      "text": "Opening, reading, knowing and\ndelivery stay distinct\nThe plugin witnesses an actual\nvisible open\nYou can also mark an exact revision\nknown\nManagement actions bind object and\nrevision\nPreferences and queries need no new\nmessage",
      "originalText": "Opening, reading, knowing and\ndelivery stay distinct\nThe plugin witnesses an actual\nvisible open\nYou can also mark an exact revision\nknown\nManagement actions bind object and\nrevision\nPreferences and queries need no new\nmessage",
